<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and standings after</p>
<p>round 11 of the super 12 rugby union tournament.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>ACT beat Waikato 48-34</p>
<p>New South Wales beat Otago 27-16</p>
<p>Queensland beat Gauteng Lions 40-27</p>
<p>Canterbury beat Free State 16-11</p>
<p>Auckland beat Wellington 45-42</p>
<p>Natal drew with Northern Transvaal 27-27</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, points</p>
<p>for, points against, bonus points, total points :</p>
<p>    Auckland	     10   9   1   0   401   263    7    45</p>
<p>    ACT		    10   7   0   3   371   262    8    36</p>
<p>    Wellington	   10   6   0   4   387   279    9    33</p>
<p>    Natal		  10   5   2   3   313   308    6    30</p>
<p>    Gauteng Lions	10   4   1   5   260   338    5    23</p>
<p>    Northern Transvaal 10   3   3   4   241   307    4    22</p>
<p>    Canterbury	   10   4   1   5   224   232    3    21</p>
<p>    Queensland	   10   4   0   6   260   270    4    20</p>
<p>    New South Wales    10   4   0   6   235   262    4    20</p>
<p>    Free State	   10   4   0   6   266   304    4    20</p>
<p>    Waikato		10   4   0   6   254   261    3    19</p>
<p>    Otago		  10   2   0   8   265   391    5    13</p>
<p>(Note: Gauteng Lions formerly Transvaal)</p>
</text>
